                              "id": "a8855ca2-12c9-4570-a677-916afcbd472d",
                              "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "The trial proves a\nlimited claim: one\nblocked branch\nneed not stop",
                                  "the clear\nbranches. It does\nnot promise that\nnothing can fail\nagain.",
                                  "Slush accepts that\nsmaller, stronger\npromise. Pip\nbegins to",
                                  "understand why\nhonest limits can\nmake people feel\nsafer."
                                ],
