                              "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
                              "args": {
                                "text": [
                                  "The festival\ncommittee arrives\nwith ribbon\nmeasured in\nambitious",
                                  "lengths. Nib asks\nthem to wait while\nthe crew assigns\nthe spare",
                                  "keys. This may be\nhis least\ntheatrical moment.\nIt is also the\nfirst",
                                  "time the committee\ntakes him entirely\nseriously."
                                ],
